{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"root","type":"text","text":"# Nora\nVoice AI assistant","x":-150,"y":-60,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"b0","type":"text","text":"## Real-time voice","x":-129,"y":-455,"width":260,"height":70,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d0","type":"text","text":"- Wake word: openWakeWord or Porcupine\n- VAD: Silero\n- STT: whisper.cpp with Vulkan\n- TTS: Piper (or ElevenLabs/Cartesia)\n- Barge-in with echo cancellation\n- Target: < 1 s (MVP < 2 s)","x":-169,"y":-920,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b1","type":"text","text":"## Hybrid brain","x":139,"y":-356,"width":260,"height":70,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"d1","type":"text","text":"- Local: Ollama/LM Studio, quantized 12–14B\n- Heavy: ChatGPT, with Claude as fallback\n- Router: triage, second chance, voice commands\n- Holding phrase\n- Game mode frees VRAM (leave with confirmation)\n- `keep_alive` unloads the model","x":357,"y":-728,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"b2","type":"text","text":"## Memory","x":283,"y":-107,"width":260,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d2","type":"text","text":"- SQLite + sqlite-vec\n- Raw history (total memory)\n- Curated memory (RAG), by area\n- Date agenda\n- Learns pronunciation and way of speaking\n- Knowledge\n- Future: LoRA\n- Forget and delete for good\n- Half-finished answers (resume)\n- Obsidian notes\n- Self-improvement: daily report, with approval","x":637,"y":-282,"width":340,"height":340,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b3","type":"text","text":"## Extensions","x":233,"y":174,"width":260,"height":70,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"d3","type":"text","text":"- Everything on the MCP standard\n- Orchestrator = persona\n- Specialists: agenda, research, PC/home, memory","x":540,"y":309,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b4","type":"text","text":"## HUD","x":13,"y":359,"width":260,"height":70,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"d4","type":"text","text":"- Electron or Tauri\n- Three.js orb reacting to the voice\n- Cards, clock, status","x":110,"y":670,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b5","type":"text","text":"## Distributed mode","x":-273,"y":359,"width":260,"height":70,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d5","type":"text","text":"- 24h body: mini PC\n- Brain: main PC\n- API as fallback","x":-450,"y":670,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b6","type":"text","text":"## Hardware","x":-493,"y":175,"width":260,"height":70,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d6","type":"text","text":"- RX 9060 XT 16 GB → Vulkan/ROCm, avoid CUDA-only\n- Ryzen 7 9800X3D\n- 32 GB DDR5\n- NVMe: models and database","x":-880,"y":310,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b7","type":"text","text":"## Open source","x":-543,"y":-107,"width":260,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d7","type":"text","text":"- `data/` and `.env` outside Git\n- No Marvel branding\n- Configurable name\n- All rights reserved\n- Check model and voice licenses","x":-977,"y":-242,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b8","type":"text","text":"## Idea bank","x":-399,"y":-356,"width":260,"height":70,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"d8","type":"text","text":"- Camera: presence\n- Local face recognition\n- Privacy first\n- Obsidian: index ✅ (v0.3.0); graph in the HUD\n- Switch brain and voice by command ✅ (v0.3.0)\n- Particle words in the HUD\n- Voice creation with ComfyUI","x":-697,"y":-728,"width":340,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"grp","type":"group","label":"Roadmap (⬜ pending · 🔄 in progress · ✅ done)","x":-1340,"y":1120,"width":2660,"height":220},
